          <p class="large-para mb-3">
            Event operators run a tight loop: announce, build momentum, convert, and keep audiences warm until doors open. For teams managing dozens of events,
            marketing execution becomes repetitive, manual, and error-prone—especially when content, creative, and ad setup must be rebuilt for every venue and date.
          </p>
          <p class="large-para mb-0">
            Billy Martin needed Vesta (EventVesta.com) to support a modern, scalable marketing flow: fast content production, multi-channel scheduling, performance-safe AI automation,
            and a calendar-based workflow that keeps promoters on track.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4">
            <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">Quick Stats</h3>
            <ul class="mb-0 ps-3 small" style="line-height: 1.8;">
              <li><strong>Modernization:</strong> Legacy UI → React</li>
              <li><strong>Channels:</strong> Meta (FB/IG) + Google Ads</li>
              <li><strong>Automation:</strong> Posts, ads, scheduling, reporting</li>
              <li><strong>Governance:</strong> Guardrails + explainability reports</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

