        <p class="large-para mb-3">
          We rebuilt the front-end experience with React and then designed an “AI marketing OS” around Vesta’s event data. The system ingests event details (artist/lineup, venue, timing, ticket
          tiers, audience segments) and creative inputs (images, brand voice, past performance signals) to generate campaign-ready assets.
        </p>
        <p class="large-para mb-0">
          The result is a robust workflow: content and ad generation, scheduling, approvals, and a centralized calendar that orchestrates the marketing timeline for each event—from announcement
          through last-call reminders.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

