          <li><strong>Multi-channel scheduling:</strong> Automated scheduling to Facebook + Instagram, with a calendar view and publishing guardrails.</li>
          <li><strong>Ad generation with explainability:</strong> Meta + Google campaign drafts include an AI analysis report describing why specific audiences, budgets, and angles were chosen.</li>
          <li><strong>Safety &amp; governance:</strong> Hard rules, approvals, audit logs, and “do not publish” switches prevent unsafe or off-brand automation.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
